# About:

Make friends, collaborate, and learn. Welcome to the second ever Zig Day LA.

# What to expect:

This Zig Day is still fairly small and the expected attendance is < 10 people.
It is held in a conference room in the Peninsula Center Library in RPV. The location was selected because it
is close to me, low rental cost, fits up to 21 people, and is within walking distance of a shopping center with
a few restaurants for lunch.

- wheelchair accessible
- air conditioned
- power outlets, internet
- chairs, table,
- restrooms with water fountains
- parking on-site (recommended to go to the rear of library to park at the top of parking structure)
- electric car charger (paid)

Two PCB badges (beta badge and final version) from SYCL 2026 will be loaned out to community members until the next Zig Day LA.

# Schedule:
- 10:00 AM - 10:30AM - room / workstation setup / chat
- 10:30 AM - 1:00 PM - discuss projects, form groups, begin zig
- 1:00 PM - 2:00 PM - go to local restaurant for bite to eat
- 2:00 PM - 4:15 PM - continue zig
- 4:15 PM - 4:45 PM - discuss what you learned, show off
- 4:45 PM - 5:00 PM - clean up

